01:48:11,303 --> 01:48:11,543
Nasıl?

896
01:48:12,643 --> 01:48:13,203
Harika.

897
01:48:13,603 --> 01:48:14,083
Hep beraber.

898
01:48:14,663 --> 01:48:15,223
Muhteşem.

899
